Receipt Extraction Plan
Develop a Python script to detect and extract multiple receipts from a single image using computer vision techniques.

Assumptions
Contrast: Receipts are white/light-colored or blue (Migros) on a contrasting background. Adaptive thresholding will be used to handle varying colors.
Layout: Receipts are arranged in approximately 1-2 rows. Sorting logic will handle minor vertical variations.
Shape: Receipts are roughly rectangular. Distortion/rotation is minimal but handled via deskewing where possible.
Resolution: The input image has high enough resolution to distinguish individual receipts (test images in paragony 3 confirm high resolution).
